{
  "name": "MewHub · Publicar reels en Instagram",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## MewHub · Publicar reels en Instagram\nPublica 2 reels al día rotando la lista `REELS` del Config (nombres de vídeo de /reels, sin .mp4, separados por comas).\nNecesita `META_TOKEN`: el token de Instagram (Instagram Login) de la cuenta de MewHub. Sin reels o sin token no hace nada.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 200,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a1f49099-496e-4e00-8f69-71ecf0e19e67",
      "name": "Nota 9c15",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 11
            },
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 18
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "3e92b73b-3952-491d-a699-1991d1d10ca3",
      "name": "2 al día (11 y 18 h)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const list = String($('Config').first().json.REELS || '').split(',').map(s => s.trim()).filter(Boolean);\nconst token = $('Config').first().json.META_TOKEN;\nif (!list.length || !token || token.startsWith('PEGA_AQUI')) return [];\nconst hour = Number(new Date().toLocaleString('en-GB', { timeZone: 'Europe/Madrid', hour: '2-digit', hour12: false }));\nconst day = Math.floor(Date.now() / 86400000);\nconst reel = list[(day * 2 + (hour < 15 ? 0 : 1)) % list.length];\nconst url = $('Config').first().json.APP_URL + '/reels/' + reel + '.mp4';\nreturn [{ json: { reel, token, url, cover: url.replace('/reels/', '/reels/portadas/').replace('.mp4', '.jpg'), caption: $('Config').first().json.CAPTION } }];"
      },
      "id": "d120fd5b-989d-4a60-bdca-7ba4fc62d797",
      "name": "Elegir reel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://graph.instagram.com/v21.0/me",
        "options": {},
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "fields",
              "value": "user_id,username"
            },
            {
              "name": "access_token",
              "value": "={{ $json.token }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "dd07b121-991e-44a1-a8b5-0044edacfeef",
      "name": "Comprobar cuenta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://graph.instagram.com/v21.0/{{ $json.user_id }}/media",
        "options": {},
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "media_type",
              "value": "REELS"
            },
            {
              "name": "video_url",
              "value": "={{ $('Elegir reel').item.json.url }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "cover_url",
              "value": "={{ $('Elegir reel').item.json.cover }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "caption",
              "value": "={{ $('Elegir reel').item.json.caption }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "access_token",
              "value": "={{ $('Elegir reel').item.json.token }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "95b6057a-5cf5-4a8a-99d6-3fe74f66de19",
      "name": "Subir reel",
